  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together lemon juice, nuka-pickle, olive oil, garlic, oregano, salt, and black pepper",
    "Add the beef cubes to the bowl and toss to coat",
    "Thread the beef cubes onto skewers",
    "Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally",
    "Let the skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving",
    "Serve hot and enjoy"
